SUMMARY:Mindful Recovery
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260314T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260314T170000
UID:60a715904cf52a8ced098350@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Our 8-week Mindfulness based Addiction Recovery programme has 
 helped hundreds of people free themselves of unhealthy habits. Whether thi
 s is a cycle of workaholism\, sugar cravings\, or you need a digital break
  but can’t stop checking your phone\; Mindful Recovery will help free yo
 u from unhelpful patterns of behaviour.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindful-recovery-mar-202
 6
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Wheel of Life Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260415T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260415T213000
UID:4b32c875d44ce3133e521363@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:What does it mean to be alive? Why do we suffer and what can w
 e do about it? In this six-week course\, Suryagupta\, Chair of the London 
 Buddhist Centre\, will harness her love of stories\, myths\, and symbols t
 o share the powerful image of the Tibetan Wheel of Life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/the-wheel-of-life-apr-20
 26
END:VEVENT
